A||||4||deceler8||A question for the A/C gurus...||||1||
Z||000000||deceler8||05-21-2000||09:50 PM||||Just where is the orifice tube located on a Fiero ?<P>I'm about to tear into muy system to retrofit to R134 and I'm looking to install a Smart VOV (variable orifice valve).<P>I'm putting in a new drier and fittings and O rings...anything else I should be wary of ?<P>Will probably remove the compressor to drain the old oil if it doesn't look like too much hassle.||||reg||1
Z||000001||theogre||05-21-2000||11:43 PM||||in the line that passes under the acc/dryer.<P>what year/motor is it? 87-88 4 cyl uses a V5 compressor that has variable displacement. I'm not sure a smart vov would do anything for you with that compressor.<p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 05-21-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||deceler8||05-22-2000||09:06 AM||||I've got an '86 2m4...I'm working under the assumption that my compressor is OK, but charge has slowly leaked out (car had only been driven 2,000 miles in 7 years before I bought it). <P>All my A/C experience is with other makes that don't use an orifice tube.<P>And thanks for the info...can always depend on you for info on most anything.||||reg||1
Z||000003||theogre||05-22-2000||09:25 AM||||compresor ok? maybe. as long as corrosion hasn't built up around the main shaft seal under the clutch. If it has you'll know soon enough. It can be fixed if you have the tools.<P>Smart VOV should help with the older compressor, it's the A6 I think. I believe those are fixed displacement. Keep in mind smart VOV may change how you read pressures. There should be instructions or some source of info about that if it does.<P>To a lesser extent a smart VOV does for a fixed dispalacement compressor what avariable compressor does. It helps adjust refrigerant flow based on system load. The V5 has a few extra rules you have to follow to make sure the compressor is at full load when you take pressure readings. SmartVOV may be similar. I haven't seen one to say for sure. This is just my impression after reading the online documentation for it.||||reg||1
Z||000004||deceler8||05-22-2000||12:19 PM||||Thanks again. You're right...I'll know soon enough as to the state of my compressor.||||reg||1
